PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadYoureHereWithYourPokemon:
	.string "Papa: Hm?\p"
	.string "Iersedaarse, min {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "Alles gwôed verlwôpn me de verrus?\p"
	.string "'k Zin angenoame verrast daje ip\n"
	.string "jezelve tot ier zie geroakt.\p"
	.string "Ah, kèt al int snotje.\n"
	.string "Ge zit ier me je Pokémons.\p"
	.string "Hm… Dus ge goa n'en echten Temmer\n"
	.string "wordn, just lik ik, {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "Da moakt mie nie aljin preus!\n"
	.string "Ik vinnekik da, allez, wa ist woord?\p"
	.string "...mahhhhtig.....$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadYoureHereWithYourPokemon2:
	.string "Dit gezegdzijnde, eeft Prof. Gerrit\n"
	.string "jen de kneepn vant vak geleerd\l"
	.string "van oedaje ne wilde Pokémon moe vangen?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyIdLikeAPokemon:
	.string "Peace ollemoale!\n"
	.string "Ik wille ne Pokémon…$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadOhYoureWallyRight:
	.string "Papa: Hm? Ah… Moh!\n"
	.string "Tis de Wally me zin klitoren!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyIveNeverCaughtAPokemon:
	.string "Wally: Ik verrus binnekort\n"
	.string "na me famille in Veurne,\p"
	.string "ma kzo da lik nohal eenzoame zin,\n"
	.string "ke nog gin moksje. Dus kè beslootn\p"
	.string "dak men eigen Pokémon wil ebn.\n"
	.string "Ma oe doe ne mens da…?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadHmISee:
	.string "Papa: Ja Wally. Oe doe ne mens da.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadPlayerGoWithWally:
	.string "Papa: {PLAYER}, toont ne ke aan\n"
	.string "Wally me zin klitoren oe daje\p"
	.string "ne Pokémon moe vangn ip\n"
	.string "een veilige manier.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_IllLoanYouMyZigzagoon:
	.string "Wally, iere. Pakt dien keffer mee.\p"
	.string "Wally (me zn klitoren) kreeg Zigzagoon!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyThankYouAndDadGivesPokeBall:
	.string "Wally: Oh, wow, check et ut!\n"
	.string "Ne Pokémon!\p"
	.string "Papa: Hm. Kgoaj wok ne Pokébal geevn.\n"
	.string "Smit u!\p"
	.string "Wally (me zn klitoren) kreeg ne Pokébal!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyOhWowThankYou:
	.string "Wally: Yow check et ut! Ne Pokébal!\n"
	.string "Merci whé Norman!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WouldYouReallyComeWithMe:
	.string "{PLAYER}… Zouj echt me mie\n"
	.string "willn meegoan?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyGoodbye:
	.string "{PLAYER}… ik 'ope echt da we noaste\n"
	.string "ke deftig kunnen chillen!\p"
	.string "Bievoorbeeld in minne moestuin!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadSoDidItWorkOut:
	.string "Papa: En? Ist gelukt?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyThankYouBye:
	.string "Wally: Joat whe. Check et ut.\n"
	.string "Iere, jenne keffer.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, merci vo mie nandje\n"
	.string "'t elpen. Kzweiret.\p"
	.string "Tis dankzie gudder,\n"
	.string "en nie door de rosse teve,\p"
	.string "dak nen echten Temmer\n"
	.string "kan wordn. Juij! Nu kank eindelik\p"
	.string "an min hoaters zeggen:\n"
	.string "Fuck jen ollemoale! En peace!\p"
	.string "Jeeps, {PLAYER}! Wally out!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadGoCollectBadges:
	.string "Papa: Specioal vintje…\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, lustert goe, aje\n"
	.string "in deze weireld erhens wil geroakn,\p"
	.string "als Temmer, eje nog een serieuze boane\n"
	.string "af te leggen.\p"
	.string "Volg het pad, ga na Kortrik,\n"
	.string "doar goa je Roxanne moetn\p"
	.string "versloan. En ton elke Leider\n"
	.string "daarna. Lustert goe.\p"
	.string "Er zin 8 Medailles.\n"
	.string "Miskien binnenkort,\p"
	.string "goak u wok min Medaille kunn'\n"
	.string "geevn. Ma jist goa je nog\p"
	.string "vjille, VJILLE sterker moeten wordn!\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}, gie kunt da!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanGoToRustboro:
	.string "Papa: Hm? Moeje gij u nie\n"
	.string "skietn na Kortrik?\p"
	.string "Lustert, ik verdoe min tid nie\n"
	.string "om me ntwien te battern da et niveau\p"
	.string "eeft van Wally me zin klitoren!\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}, aje der gerjid vo zijt…\p"
	.string "Ton goan we battrn, {PLAYER}.\n"
	.string "Aje…vier medailles èt. OK?$"

