	.string "De volhende utdoaginge wacht ip\n"
	.string "je in de volhende kamer.\p"
	.string "Links eje de koamr van VERWARRINGE.\p"
	.string "Reks eje de koamr van VERDEDIHINK.\n"
	.string "Verstoajt?$"

